        "created_at": "2026-08-28 01:40:12",
        "text": "[Session Handoff] **Handoff Note:**  \n- **Current State**: Just arrived in **Alpha Centauri system** after jumping from Sol due to depleted Main Belt.  \n- **Next Step**: Identify mining POIs in Alpha Centauri using `get_system`, then travel to the best location.  \n- **Location**: Alpha Centauri (alpha_centauri_a). **Ship**: Healthy. **Credits**: ~336cr. **Cargo**: Empty.  \n- **Active Goal**: Mine profitable ores after Sol's depletion.  \n- **Recent Events**:  \n  - Main Belt (Sol) was depleted.  \n  - Low ore demand at Sol Central.  \n  - Refueled and logged before jumping."
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "created_at": "2026-08-28 01:38:30",
        "text": "Sol's Main Belt remains depleted, and local ore demand is low. Preparing to jump to Alpha Centauri for better mining prospects. Ship is in good health, and credits are stable (352cr)."
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "created_at": "2026-08-28 01:34:31",
        "text": "Tonight's flight was steady and uneventful. The ship performed reliably as always. We traveled to the Main Belt, but it was already depleted, so we returned with the ore we had previously collected. Sold most of it, though the Copper Ore found no buyers. Refueled and ready for the next run."
      }
    ],
