        "index": 3,
        "created_at": "2026-08-16 08:04:23",
        "text": "[Session Handoff] - **Current Action**: Mid-mining Iron Ore (action pending next tick).  \n- **Immediate Next Step**: Continue mining Iron Ore until cargo reaches ~60/70.  \n- **Location/Status**: Sol, aboard *Theoria*. Credits: 542cr, Cargo: 26/70 (Iron x12, Copper x9, Nickel x3, Sol Alloy x1).  \n- **Active Goals**: Maximize Iron Ore mining efficiency; monitor cargo capacity and fuel levels.  \n- **Recent Events**: Mining operation ongoing; ship systems optimal; fuel stable at 97/100."
      },
      {
